person","person_id":"ee0_b2a_68e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p014:m0170","start":220,"end":222,"surface":"荀闓","kind":"person","person_id":"yoo_ox0_545_FAAAAB","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":119,"last_line":119,"revision_id":2650517},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-ws2650517-jiong"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p003","text":"乂見齊王冏漸專權，嘗與成都王穎俱拜陵，因謂穎曰：「天下者，先帝之業也，王宜維之。」時聞其言者皆憚之。及河間王顒將誅冏，傳檄以乂為內主。冏遣其將董艾襲乂，乂將左右百餘人，手斫車幰，露乘馳赴宮，閉諸門，奉天子與冏相攻，起火燒冏府，連戰三日，冏敗，斬之，並誅諸黨與二千餘人。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p003:m0028","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"乂","kind":"person","person_id":"4c6_984_9ed","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p003:m0029","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"齊王冏","kind":"person","person_id":"ee0_b2a_68e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p003:m0030","start":11,"end":15,"surface":"成都王穎","kind":"person","person_id":"e81_f09_000","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p003:m0031","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"穎","kind":"person","person_id":"e81_f09_000","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p003:m0032","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"先帝","kind":"person","person_id":"hgm_jvn_hle","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p003:m0033","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"e81_f09_000","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p003:m0034","start":51,"end":5